{"id":358,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Can emit waves of air powerful enough to knock out prey taller than itself. I hypothesize that it amplifies the faint sound of wind within its body."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"In high winds, Chimecho cries as it hangs from a tree branch or the eaves of a building using a suction cup on its head. This Pokémon plucks berries with its long tail and eats them."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Chimecho makes its cries echo inside its hollow body. When this Pokémon becomes enraged, its cries result in ultrasonic waves that have the power to knock foes flying."},{"games":["Y","Pearl"],"text":"Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It uses the sucker on its head to hang from a tree or from eaves. It can produce seven different tones."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"To knock foes flying, it makes the air shudder with its cries. It converses using seven cries."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It travels by riding on winds. It cleverly uses its long tail to pluck nuts and berries, which it loves to eat."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"They fly about very actively when the hot season arrives. They communicate among themselves using seven different and distinguishing cries."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"grassland","color":"Blue","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":433,"name":"Chingling","condition":null,"children":[{"id":358,"name":"Chimecho","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Night)","children":[]}]},"moves